     etherpad's `enter.spec.ts: enter is always visible after event` green —
     that test measured the last line against the *browser* viewport, so any
     chrome above the editor iframe failed it. Core dropped that assertion as
     inherently fragile (ether/etherpad#7845), so the bar no longer has to be
     unreadably small. See ether/ep_set_title_on_pad#155. */
  #pad_title {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
